WEBVTT

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:07.240
Mom! Dad!

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:09.410
Just do as I say!

00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:09.780
I got the top score on my test at school-

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:11.000
You're always like that!

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:13.820
Have you ever thought about my feelings, even once?

00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:14.420
You don't understand anything!

00:00:14.470 --> 00:00:16.840
It's you who doesn't understand anything!

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:18.740
It's because you say things like that...

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:28.580
So, if you put it into this formula, the answer should be easy to extrapolate.

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:31.620
Oh, I get it!

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:32.920
Wow!

00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:34.420
It's Lein!

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:37.540
Lein, can we hang out with you?

00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:39.600
Who's that?

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:48.000
I read your report yesterday; it was very interesting.

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:50.760
I expect great things from you.

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.170
Yes, sir.

00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:01.600
This person...

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:07.390
Professor Lein's thesis is marvelous!

00:01:07.570 --> 00:01:09.910
What's his brain made of?

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:11.820
I just can't believe it.

00:01:14.930 --> 00:01:17.790
Why do they only care about him?

00:01:18.810 --> 00:01:20.020
Elenfriet?

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:21.690
Elenfriet?

00:01:21.820 --> 00:01:23.100
Elenfriet?

00:01:24.870 --> 00:01:26.300
How many minutes has it been?

00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:28.230
About ten.

00:01:28.360 --> 00:01:31.810
I've just wasted ten minutes I don't have...

00:01:34.270 --> 00:01:36.540
And? How's the final tuning going?

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:39.890
Yes sir, it's ready to be activated at any time.

00:01:40.010 --> 00:01:41.140
I see.

00:01:42.070 --> 00:01:44.890
At last, the hour has come.

00:01:45.070 --> 00:01:47.500
I will rise above him!

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:50.170
Now, it's time to awaken...

00:01:52.270 --> 00:01:53.480
Jinx.

00:03:26.030 --> 00:03:29.040
Phase 08: Jinx

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:48.000
Angelique?

00:03:48.060 --> 00:03:49.400
That's amazing, Lein!

00:03:49.430 --> 00:03:53.360
No, it wasn't. I missed the last shot.

00:03:53.560 --> 00:03:58.140
Well, this <i>is</i> a change. Usually, you're locked away in your room, researching...

00:03:58.210 --> 00:03:59.900
I've never seen you practicing your shooting.

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:02.930
I'm preparing, just in case.

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:04.560
In case of what?

00:04:06.770 --> 00:04:08.110
Sometimes, I think...

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:15.110
I want to at least be able to protect myself.

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:17.270
That's our job.

00:04:17.830 --> 00:04:20.270
But I'm jealous.

00:04:20.390 --> 00:04:25.990
Not only do you have the power to purify Thanatos, but you also have the ability to protect yourself...

00:04:27.110 --> 00:04:28.580
Purify Thanatos, huh?

00:04:29.670 --> 00:04:31.310
Angie, Lein!

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:32.860
Nyx wants you!

00:04:32.900 --> 00:04:34.270
Okay!

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:37.480
Angelique...

00:04:38.580 --> 00:04:40.070
I swear on this coin...

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:43.920
I won't make any more mistakes.

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:46.110
So that I can protect the things I care about...

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:47.780
Right?

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:51.020
Right.

00:04:54.070 --> 00:04:57.950
I'm sure you all know why I've gathered you here...

00:04:58.140 --> 00:05:02.320
I've just received word from Bernal at the Wodon Times.

00:05:03.180 --> 00:05:07.830
The Artifact Foundation will make an important announcement in Pharia tomorrow.

00:05:07.930 --> 00:05:10.630
An important announcement?

00:05:10.730 --> 00:05:16.280
They've been quite active recently; it probably has something to do with the Thanatos.

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:21.520
You're correct. It appears that they're unveiling an anti-Thanatos weapon.

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:23.700
What?

00:05:25.480 --> 00:05:27.110
What's wrong, Lein?

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:29.530
I've got a bad feeling about this.

00:05:29.670 --> 00:05:33.970
As they are now, the Foundation shouldn't be capable of making anything that advanced.

00:05:34.380 --> 00:05:38.680
Pharia... this time, I have to go there.

00:05:51.980 --> 00:05:54.670
Good afternoon, Bernal.

00:05:55.950 --> 00:05:57.350
Hey Angelique.

00:05:57.440 --> 00:05:59.290
Sorry to scare you.

00:05:59.430 --> 00:06:05.100
In my line of work, it becomes a reflex to take a picture whenever a beautiful subject appears.

00:06:06.490 --> 00:06:08.270
You're immersed in your work like always.

00:06:08.480 --> 00:06:10.760
Are you doing research in this area?

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:11.510
Yeah...

00:06:11.550 --> 00:06:15.500
Sometimes the best place to seek out the truth is in the shadow of a luminous city.

00:06:15.720 --> 00:06:19.420
Of course, the Foundation doesn't seem interested.

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:24.050
It's about to start.

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:25.900
You...

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:28.610
Y-You're the Orb Hunter...

00:06:30.770 --> 00:06:32.500
I, um... see.

00:06:34.570 --> 00:06:37.990
I told you! You'll actually stand out more with that!

00:06:38.050 --> 00:06:42.060
I can't help it! The Foundation is after me!

00:06:42.510 --> 00:06:45.960
But it's cool. You look like a hero!

00:06:46.410 --> 00:06:47.880
Thanks, Angie.

00:06:49.110 --> 00:06:52.570
He'll be here in five seconds, so I'm on my way.

00:06:58.880 --> 00:07:01.160
My, my, Professor Lein.

00:07:01.200 --> 00:07:03.160
Thank you for coming.

00:07:03.190 --> 00:07:04.930
You're here again, Elen?

00:07:05.100 --> 00:07:08.240
I've told you before: I'm not a professor.

00:07:08.290 --> 00:07:14.130
And I've told you before that my name is Elenfriet.

00:07:16.140 --> 00:07:18.320
Um, Elenfriet...

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:21.740
I'm looking forward to the ceremony today.

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:30.440
I think it's wonderful that research into Artifacts is being used to make people happy.

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:32.870
To make people happy?

00:07:32.990 --> 00:07:37.970
Yes, if we can work together with the Foundation...

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:45.860
That's pretty funny. I never thought I'd hear those words from the Queen's Egg.

00:07:46.310 --> 00:07:49.720
Honestly, we don't need your powers at all anymore.

00:07:50.650 --> 00:07:54.190
Though, the data we acquired from you was helpful to a degree.

00:07:55.390 --> 00:07:56.700
Data?

00:07:56.740 --> 00:07:58.590
You can't have...

00:07:59.990 --> 00:08:02.260
Enjoy the ceremony.

00:08:16.830 --> 00:08:20.640
I knew it... to me, this sound is...

00:08:20.970 --> 00:08:21.990
Nyx!

00:08:24.040 --> 00:08:25.030
Angelique...

00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:26.840
Are you okay?

00:08:27.120 --> 00:08:30.990
We couldn't find you, so we all came looking.

00:08:31.730 --> 00:08:35.050
I'm sorry. I'm feeling a bit dizzy...

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:38.320
I'm going to take a short rest at the café.

00:08:38.470 --> 00:08:40.410
Then, I'll go with you...

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:43.330
Don't worry, Angelique.

00:08:43.720 --> 00:08:48.860
I'm off to enjoy the sweet sorrow that is being apart from you for a while.

00:08:50.260 --> 00:08:51.400
Nyx!

00:08:52.810 --> 00:08:56.400
Good afternoon everyone. I am the Director of the Artifact Foundation, Yorgo.

00:08:56.670 --> 00:09:01.390
Even as we speak, many people are suffering at the hands of the Thanatos.

00:09:01.730 --> 00:09:08.990
Will the Order, the Knights of the Silver Tree, or the Prophesied Queen be the ones to save our world?

00:09:09.710 --> 00:09:13.300
No, it's too late to wait for them.

00:09:14.190 --> 00:09:15.050
Yorgo...

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:23.130
My foundation has developed the fruits of many years of research, the anti-Thanatos Artifact Weapon, Jinx.

00:09:23.810 --> 00:09:25.890
Jinx.

00:09:35.120 --> 00:09:35.980
What's wrong?

00:09:36.070 --> 00:09:37.780
For some reason, I'm scared.

00:09:38.100 --> 00:09:40.770
The time when we lived in fear of Thanatos attacks has passed!

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:47.650
Now, it's not the Knights or the Order who shall save this word, but us, the Artifact Foundation!

00:09:58.230 --> 00:09:59.230
A Thanatos?

00:10:01.880 --> 00:10:02.970
Please remain calm.

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:06.810
This is a Thanatos that stowed away among trade goods being imported from the East.

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:11.380
We sealed it in the container it hid in  so that we could test the Jinx's strength.

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:13.400
What on Earth is he thinking?

00:10:13.770 --> 00:10:14.860
Director Yorgo.

00:10:15.480 --> 00:10:16.510
Indeed.

00:10:18.170 --> 00:10:20.240
Jinx... initiate.

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:29.540
Your target is the captured Thanatos.

00:10:30.340 --> 00:10:31.820
Output to maximum.

00:10:35.340 --> 00:10:36.110
Stop!

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:37.660
Lein!

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:41.230
If he releases that much energy in such a crowded place...

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:44.240
Fire.

00:11:07.490 --> 00:11:09.580
The Thanatos is gone!

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:10.730
Amazing!

00:11:16.240 --> 00:11:20.420
Director Yorgo will have to recognize my accomplishments now.

00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:22.540
What do you think, Lein?

00:11:23.350 --> 00:11:26.510
Right now, I stand above you!

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:32.840
It really took out that Thanatos with one hit?

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:35.390
Yeah, no doubt about it.

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:37.040
No way...

00:11:38.280 --> 00:11:39.690
They'll be here soon.

00:11:42.400 --> 00:11:45.610
Their companion's dying screams summons them.

00:11:46.450 --> 00:11:47.600
We can talk later.

00:11:47.660 --> 00:11:49.460
Let's go, Angelique!

00:11:49.530 --> 00:11:50.530
Wait.

00:11:51.010 --> 00:11:55.610
We haven't asked the Orb Hunters for aid.

00:11:56.110 --> 00:11:59.050
Jinx, lock on to Targets Two and Three.

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:00.740
Commence charging sequence.

00:12:03.220 --> 00:12:04.180
You...

00:12:04.630 --> 00:12:05.510
Fire.

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:12.450
Watch out!

00:12:17.310 --> 00:12:18.400
What are you doing?

00:12:18.440 --> 00:12:19.580
Leave this to me!

00:12:20.370 --> 00:12:22.020
Hurry up and ready the next charge!

00:12:22.740 --> 00:12:23.590
Hurry!

00:12:23.610 --> 00:12:24.770
This way, quickly!

00:12:24.830 --> 00:12:26.760
Damn, this is terrible...

00:12:32.450 --> 00:12:33.170
Go!

00:12:33.230 --> 00:12:34.950
You're...

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:37.880
The heroes.

00:12:39.290 --> 00:12:41.320
Don't say that. It's embarrassing.

00:12:44.430 --> 00:12:45.360
Angelique!

00:12:45.430 --> 00:12:46.260
Right!

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:56.830
The other one...

00:12:59.130 --> 00:13:00.160
There's a kid!

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:02.090
And a Thanatos!

00:13:02.680 --> 00:13:04.330
There's no time!

00:13:08.830 --> 00:13:09.610
Nyx!

00:13:09.640 --> 00:13:12.520
Save me.

00:13:17.540 --> 00:13:19.460
Save me!

00:13:19.530 --> 00:13:22.950
I don't wanna die!

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:26.470
Nyx!

00:13:26.510 --> 00:13:27.550
Nyx!

00:13:32.440 --> 00:13:33.700
Target locked.

00:13:33.850 --> 00:13:34.950
Output to maximum.

00:13:34.980 --> 00:13:37.210
Stop! There are people there!

00:13:37.610 --> 00:13:39.270
Make him stop, Yorgo!

00:13:39.310 --> 00:13:41.030
Tell him to stop the Jinx!

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:41.990
Fire!

00:13:55.650 --> 00:13:56.550
Far away...

00:13:56.770 --> 00:13:57.800
Nyx!

00:13:58.760 --> 00:14:03.510
Somewhere where I can't hear this accursed sound... the pounding of the waves...

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:04.640
Nyx!

00:14:04.710 --> 00:14:05.870
Nyx!

00:14:16.700 --> 00:14:19.520
I can't move...

00:14:20.280 --> 00:14:23.410
Am I just going to...

00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:43.900
Angelique?

00:14:44.160 --> 00:14:47.390
Nyx... there's no need to worry.

00:14:47.490 --> 00:14:49.440
Your complexion is back to normal.

00:14:49.540 --> 00:14:51.780
Angie's been watching over you the whole time.

00:14:52.050 --> 00:14:53.510
Thank you very much.

00:14:53.920 --> 00:14:57.880
It seems your light reached my heart.

00:14:57.960 --> 00:14:59.530
N-No...

00:14:59.590 --> 00:15:02.590
Fortunately, the child who fell into the sea escaped injury.

00:15:02.690 --> 00:15:04.060
Glad to hear it.

00:15:04.150 --> 00:15:08.810
But their house is now in ruins.

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:16.250
I'm going to Wodon and reporting every little detail about the Foundation's actions here.

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:17.370
I'm off too.

00:15:17.970 --> 00:15:19.510
Where are you going?

00:15:19.630 --> 00:15:22.700
I'm going to the Foundation to see Yorgo.

00:15:22.830 --> 00:15:24.320
But you can't just show up there.

00:15:25.010 --> 00:15:26.070
Don't worry.

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:29.050
He... Yorgo...

00:15:29.300 --> 00:15:30.710
He's my brother!

00:15:34.220 --> 00:15:37.430
Yorgo is Lein's brother.

00:15:37.900 --> 00:15:40.610
You didn't know?

00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:44.500
A few years ago...

00:15:45.530 --> 00:15:51.510
after graduating from university, Lein joined the Foundation at the request of his brother, Yorgo.

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:53.930
And he advanced quickly.

00:15:54.250 --> 00:15:56.890
He was renowned as a first-class scientist.

00:15:57.950 --> 00:16:03.010
But over time, he started to argue with Director Yorgo and in the end, left the Foundation.

00:16:05.500 --> 00:16:06.470
Lein...

00:16:07.470 --> 00:16:08.790
What are you thinking?

00:16:08.870 --> 00:16:11.910
Destroying the town, even putting human lives at risk...

00:16:11.990 --> 00:16:13.750
How is that going to save the world?

00:16:13.840 --> 00:16:20.230
"The needs of the many outweigh the needs of the few;" at times, one person must be sacrificed so that one hundred survive.

00:16:20.360 --> 00:16:22.440
Is that how the Foundation works?

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:25.880
There are a lot of people who have lost their homes because of this!

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:29.480
We did not anticipate this eventuality.

00:16:29.980 --> 00:16:31.920
We'll provide a nominal amount of reparation.

00:16:31.970 --> 00:16:33.040
Even so...

00:16:33.070 --> 00:16:34.790
You of all people should understand this.

00:16:35.670 --> 00:16:39.480
It would have been unacceptable for the ceremony to fail there.

00:16:40.770 --> 00:16:45.880
That is all. I don't have the time to talk to people who aren't related to the Foundation.

00:16:46.050 --> 00:16:46.920
Wait!

00:16:47.030 --> 00:16:50.550
Wasn't the Jinx itself a failure, not just the ceremony?

00:16:53.210 --> 00:16:54.250
Director Yorgo!

00:16:54.490 --> 00:16:58.060
There's no need to listen to that traitor's opinion!

00:17:01.840 --> 00:17:07.040
That weapon has a flaw: its specialism as an anti-Thanatos platform means that it's auto-firing mechanism...

00:17:07.280 --> 00:17:10.080
cannot recognize the presence of buildings or people!

00:17:11.550 --> 00:17:17.060
As you can see, it's too dangerous to use unless you increase the capability of its sensors.

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:19.510
Impressive.

00:17:20.230 --> 00:17:23.330
Lein, you certainly live up to expectations.

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:30.990
Modify the Jinx in accordance with this design. When it's finished, prepare for mass production.

00:17:32.020 --> 00:17:33.800
But Director Yorgo...

00:17:35.140 --> 00:17:36.610
Don't make me repeat myself.

00:17:36.790 --> 00:17:38.040
Make it snappy.

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:41.770
Yes sir, Director Yorgo.

00:17:47.820 --> 00:17:49.450
He's still inexperienced.

00:17:49.840 --> 00:17:54.460
If he had a good supervisor to show him the way, I could trust him...

00:18:06.690 --> 00:18:08.420
You can have that back.

00:18:09.870 --> 00:18:11.950
I've memorized it already.

00:18:12.050 --> 00:18:15.520
That Jasper Doll copy... was that you too?

00:18:16.530 --> 00:18:18.020
It's well-made, isn't it?

00:18:18.330 --> 00:18:24.380
I'll say this only once: don't use Artifacts to attain a reputation as a researcher.

00:18:24.720 --> 00:18:28.500
Nobody benefits from creating something so dangerous.

00:18:28.730 --> 00:18:33.780
Peril and sacrifice are natural obstacles of human evolution.

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:36.310
Right, Professor Lein?

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:39.550
You're like me.

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:40.610
What?

00:18:41.360 --> 00:18:44.860
I used to be like you.

00:18:47.590 --> 00:18:48.830
Shut up!

00:18:48.900 --> 00:18:51.290
I made Jinx myself!

00:18:51.330 --> 00:18:53.650
And you... You!

00:18:53.690 --> 00:18:55.900
You can never understand how I feel!

00:18:55.930 --> 00:18:56.830
Lein!

00:18:59.010 --> 00:19:00.030
Angelique?

00:19:01.220 --> 00:19:04.570
You were late, so everyone was worried.

00:19:04.600 --> 00:19:05.610
I'm sorry.

00:19:05.760 --> 00:19:07.180
I'm done.

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:14.570
Um, even if they're trying to save people, I think the Foundation is going about all wrong.

00:19:16.140 --> 00:19:20.490
But you said it, didn't you? You want to work with us.

00:19:21.520 --> 00:19:23.540
I'm not so sure now.

00:19:24.020 --> 00:19:27.990
Anyway, we'll do everything within our power...

00:19:28.050 --> 00:19:30.290
Then, let me tell you something:

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:36.330
the man next to you was once a researcher for the Foundation.

00:19:37.120 --> 00:19:39.800
His power is the same as the Jinx's.

00:19:42.280 --> 00:19:43.280
Let's go.

00:19:49.600 --> 00:19:52.340
It's true, what Elenfriet said.

00:19:54.640 --> 00:19:59.680
My power was created when I was researching how to turn people into Purifiers.

00:19:59.680 --> 00:20:01.250
It's not an ability I was born with.

00:20:03.050 --> 00:20:04.520
Back then,

00:20:05.840 --> 00:20:11.360
I loved satisfying my intellectual curiosity by obsessing over my research.

00:20:12.720 --> 00:20:15.220
I never really thought about the results.

00:20:23.060 --> 00:20:28.190
I never thought that I would hurt anyone or put them in danger.

00:20:29.050 --> 00:20:31.520
But one day, I woke up.

00:20:32.730 --> 00:20:37.660
If I kept on with this research, I'd lose what was really important.

00:20:39.080 --> 00:20:43.880
So, I destroyed everything I'd built and left the Foundation.

00:20:44.300 --> 00:20:48.620
Elenfriet is doing exactly the same thing I did.

00:20:48.940 --> 00:20:49.820
Lein.

00:20:49.920 --> 00:20:53.780
I'm the only one who can stop him.

00:20:55.280 --> 00:20:59.470
With my fake power, that's asking too much of me.

00:20:59.700 --> 00:21:03.810
Oh my, yes. I don't think you could do much on your own.

00:21:03.890 --> 00:21:06.750
Yes, it'd be quite difficult to do it alone.

00:21:07.070 --> 00:21:09.420
We can't help you?

00:21:27.500 --> 00:21:29.910
Pass me that coin.

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:52.140
Let's all do it together... to protect everything we hold dear.

00:21:56.390 --> 00:21:57.100
Yes!

00:23:36.690 --> 00:23:38.580
I hear you went to downtown Wodon.

00:23:38.600 --> 00:23:39.690
No comment.

00:23:39.710 --> 00:23:42.040
I hear it was a secret date too.

00:23:42.060 --> 00:23:43.300
No comment!

